# Draconid Emerald title screen (round 1 v2, D-276 / D-277): the whole opening movie runs into the title
# (no key pressed), then Regidrago's glow cycle, then START -> the main menu.
#   python3 tools/hack/emu/play.py tools/hack/emu/tests/title.play -o /tmp/title
# Shots: intro_end (the movie's last scene), logo_1 (the POKéMON logo alone), logo_2..4 (the banner
# fading in and sliding down while the logo slides up), glow_0..6 (the full title every 40 frames across one 256-frame
# glow cycle; PRESS START blinks every 16 frames, so it shows on every other shot), menu (after START).
run 3300
shot intro_end
# the movie hands over to the title screen
until @gMain+4 4 @@CB2_InitTitleScreen 1200
run 120
shot logo_1
run 190
shot logo_2
run 16
shot logo_3
run 16
shot logo_4
run 180
shot glow_0
run 40
shot glow_1
run 40
shot glow_2
run 40
shot glow_3
run 40
shot glow_4
run 40
shot glow_5
run 40
shot glow_6
press START 2 10
until @gMain+4 4 @@CB2_MainMenu 600
run 120
shot menu
